    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An action-adventure platformer in the metroidvania subgenre. The graphics are made in the style of a checkered notebook and blue ink.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat crowds of monsters, overcome traps, explore the game world, unlock new characters and find secrets! And all this to the accompaniment of driving music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/ab497717c5c86fdad19c9cdd5a576f11.avif?t=1740928778\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On one quiet and peaceful night, a mysterious star awakens a knight drawn on a notebook page. Lured by its glow, he falls through the notebook into a world of adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the knight must face various trials and adventures to discover why the star summoned him to this world and how he can find his way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015580/extras/059f64ef692356206de40f4b6587b6d0.avif?t=1740928778\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the thrilling world of Painted Legend!</strong> In our metroidvania platformer, you'll dive into a unique world that looks like it came straight from the pages of a paper notebook. Prepare for epic battles, intricate puzzles, and dangerous traps scattered throughout castles and dungeons filled with fearsome monsters and enchanting fairy tale creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Art Style</strong>: Every detail of the game's world is hand-drawn in the style of notebook sketches, creating an unparalleled atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety of Characters</strong>: Play as a knight, mage, viking, and other fantasy heroes, each with their unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration and Adventure</strong>: Immerse yourself in a vast world full of secrets and hidden paths. Explore castles, dungeons, and many other locations filled with dangers and adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles and Traps</strong>: Overcome complex obstacles with hordes of enemies and puzzles to advance the storyline and meet your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Battles</strong>: Fight against numerous diverse monsters and bosses, each requiring a unique strategy to defeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our adventure and become the hero of a drawn world! An exciting journey full of discoveries and challenges awaits you. Be bold, future legend, the world needs you!</p>",
